Package: disprr
Type: Package
Title: Simulate Proportional Representation Election Results and Compute
    Disproportionality Measures
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Michal", "Pierzgalski", email = "pierzgal@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulate election results using various proportional
    representation algorithms (D'Hondt, Sainte-Lague, Huntington-Hill,
    Adams, Hamilton-Hare, and others) to apportion seats. Compute and plot
    per-party and aggregate disproportionality measures including the
    Gallagher index, Loosemore-Hanby index, and Sainte-Lague index.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    gtools (>= 3.5.0),
    psych (>= 2.0.0),
    truncdist (>= 1.0-2),
    viridis (>= 0.6.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
